    "title": "Password Managers: Safety, Types, and How to Choose",
    "question": "Is a password manager actually safe to use, and which type should I choose?",
    "summary": "Password managers are widely considered safe and are recommended by major cybersecurity organizations as a best practice for managing credentials. This article explains how they work, their risks, and how to choose between cloud-based, offline, and browser-based types.",
